OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA partly
OL,6,Fcloudy evening with isolated light
OL,7,Fshowers around. Showers mostly easing
OL,8,Faway from the Suffolk coast overnight
OL,9,Fwith many areas turning cool and dry.
OL,10,FBreezy especially around the coasts.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FCloudy to start with showers
OL,13,Falong the coast. Showers likely to
OL,14,Fspread inland through the day but
OL,15,Fremain light. Breezy with temperatures
OL,16,Fnear average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
